{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107551","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107551/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107551/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107551/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107551","id":3146973699,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc67kwID","number":107551,"title":"AudioStreamPlayer doesn't fade in sound on start","user":{"login":"ObaniGemini","id":11649956,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjQ5OTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11649956?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini","html_url":"https://github.com/ObaniGemini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ObaniGemini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-06-15T01:49:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T11:30:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: master, 4.4.1, probably before too\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen playing a sound with an AudioStreamPlayer, the start of the sound isn't interpolated to fade in the sound start, while it does a fade out for the sound stop. While this may not be a problem for most sounds effects, it is a problem for many looping sounds that don't have a fade in in the original sound to loop properly.\n\nIt an especially big issue when you load a scene that has one or more looping sounds directly hearable.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHave a looping sound with no fade in in the base sound and play it\n\nIn this video example, I use the test project to show how the sound loops properly with no clicks, but always clicks when just started.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48c67e5a-a2d6-4b09-aaa3-2ed93a572a85\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[audioloopclick.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20743201/audioloopclick.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107551/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107551/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}